## Part B — Requests Service & Controller (`api/src/requests/`)

1. **`getPublicSosRequests()` (`GET /api/requests/sos`, `@Public()`)**:
   - Queries `status: RequestStatus.OPEN`.
   - Orders by urgency (`CRITICAL` → `HIGH` → `NORMAL`) and then `createdAt ASC` (oldest first, FR-8).
   - Maps to `PublicSosRequest` (`id`, `bloodType`, `area`, `urgency`, `hospital`, `unitsStillNeeded`, `createdAt`). **Never** includes `patientReference`, `note`, `pledges`, or `donations` (R-23).
2. **`createRequest(coordinatorId, dto)` (`POST /api/requests`, `@Roles('COORDINATOR')`)**:
   - Verifies `areaId` exists via `AreasService.findByIdOrThrow(dto.areaId)`.
   - Checks for an existing `OPEN` request with the same `patientReference` (case-insensitive) and `bloodType` (R-13). If found, throws `ConflictException('An open request for this patient reference and blood type already exists.')`.
   - Creates the `OPEN` request with `unitsCollected: 0`, calls `AppLogger.logRequestCreated(...)`, and returns `CoordinatorRequestDetails`.
3. **`findAllRequests(filters)` (`GET /api/requests`, `@Roles('COORDINATOR')`)**:
   - Applies optional `status`, `bloodType`, `areaId`, and `urgency` filters (FR-7) and returns `CoordinatorRequestSummary[]` with calculated `unitsStillNeeded` and `activePledgesCount`.
4. **`findRequestById(id)` (`GET /api/requests/:id`, `@Roles('COORDINATOR')`)**:
   - Returns `CoordinatorRequestDetails` including `pledges` and `donations` (FR-13), or throws `NotFoundException('Blood request not found.')`.
5. **`updateRequest(id, dto)` (`PATCH /api/requests/:id`, `@Roles('COORDINATOR')`)**:
   - Verifies request exists (`404`) and is `OPEN` (`409 Only OPEN requests can be updated.` — R-9, R-14).
   - If `dto.unitsRequired !== undefined && dto.unitsRequired < request.unitsCollected`, throws `BadRequestException('Units required cannot be reduced below the units already collected.')` (R-12).
   - Inside `prisma.$transaction`: updates the request; if the updated `unitsRequired === request.unitsCollected` and `request.unitsCollected > 0`, sets `status = RequestStatus.FULFILLED`, updates all `PLEDGED` pledges on this request to `RELEASED` (R-11, R-18), and logs `AppLogger.logRequestFulfilled(id)`.
6. **`cancelRequest(id, dto)` (`PATCH /api/requests/:id/cancel`, `@Roles('COORDINATOR')`)**:
   - Verifies request exists (`404`) and is `OPEN` (`409 Only OPEN requests can be cancelled.` — R-9, R-14).
   - Inside `prisma.$transaction`: sets `status = RequestStatus.CANCELLED`, saves `cancelReason`, and updates all `PLEDGED` pledges on this request to `RELEASED` (Flow E, R-18). Calls `AppLogger.logRequestCancelled(id, dto.cancelReason)`.
7. **`getEligibleDonors(id)` (`GET /api/requests/:id/eligible-donors`, `@Roles('COORDINATOR')`)**:
   - Verifies request exists (`404`) and is `OPEN` (`409 Eligible donors can only be matched for OPEN requests.` — R-9).
   - Delegates to `MatchingService.getEligibleDonorsForRequest(id)` (Flow B, FR-9).

